<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EmCare cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EmCare cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it downgraded EmCare Holdings Inc to hold from buy on price.</p>
<p>-- said shares have increased close to 40 percent since mid-May.</p>
<p>-- said has strong confidence in its second quarter earnings estimate of $0.36 a share.</p>
<p>-- said would look for any weakness in the stock as an opportunity to upgrade the shares.</p>
<p>-- EmCare lost 7/16 to 38.</p>
</text>
